"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, luigismansion.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. If you don't already have Dolphin Emulator, you can enable its toggle and it will be downloaded in your 'Documents' directory.",
