"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"Luigi's Mansion is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'luigismansion.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"REMEMBER TO USE THE 'PATCH DOLPHIN' BUTTON IN THE SETUP TAB AFTER SETTING UP!!\n\nOnce everything is set up, the host will need to go to the room you'll be using for your Archipelago session on the Archipelago website. Once you have the room, you'll need to click the 'Download Patch File' next to your name.\n\nAfter it is downloaded, open the Archipelago Launcher and open 'Open Patch' to use the patch file (.aplm), it will ask you to select your patch file, 'Dolphin.exe' and then your ROM.\n\nIt will open a Text Client where you'll need to connect just like you would on any other client.\n\nIt should also open the emulator with the modded ROM automatically!\n\nIf you want to reconnect, open the 'LM Client' on the Archipelago Launcher and open the patched ROM with Dolphin (the randomized ROM can be found in the same directory as your patch file).",
"kill",
"[HEADER] PopTracker Infos",
"kill",
"Some games have a PopTracker integration for Archipelago which allows you to track all possible Locations, Items, Upgrades, Zones, Hints and more depending on the game.\n\nFor the setup there are 3 different cases:\n\n\t• If the selected directory does not contain a PopTracker folder (or any similarly named folder), a new 'poptracker' folder will be created and the pack will be downloaded to poptracker\\packs.\n\n\t• If the selected directory already contains a folder with 'PopTracker' in its name, the installer will look for a poptracker.exe file. If one is found, the pack will be downloaded to its packs folder. If no poptracker.exe is found, the folder will be renamed to 'poptracker' and any missing files or folders will be created.\n\n\t• If the selected directory is already a PopTracker folder (for example: C:\\Users\\magni\\Documents\\poptracker), its contents will be validated. If everything is present, the pack will simply be downloaded to poptracker\\packs. Otherwise, the folder will be repaired before the pack is installed.",
